### ============================================================
### STAGE 1 — WRITER CREATES DRAFT
### ============================================================

### A1. Create new draft content (no content_id → new draft)
# @name createDraft
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/save/
# Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json

# {
#   "campaign_id": "fcb7e68f-87df-489e-9744-9b171f739d4b",
#   "title": "My First Blog Post",
#   "body": "This is the body of the content piece.",
#   "submit": false
# }

# ###

# ### A2. Save/update existing draft (lock required first → see Lock section)
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/save/
# Authorization: {{writerToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json

# {
#   "content_id": "{{contentId}}",
#   "title": "My First Blog Post — Updated",
#   "body": "Updated body with more details.",
#   "submit": false
# }

###

### A3. Submit for internal review (status → in_review)
###     notify_user_ids = internal member(s) to notify
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/save/
Authorization: {{writerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content_id": "{{contentId}}",
  "title": "My First Blog Post — Final",
  "body": "This is the final version ready for review.",
  "submit": true,
  "notify_user_ids": ["{{internalId}}"]
}


### ============================================================
### CONTENT LOCKING
### ============================================================

### Acquire lock (must hold lock to edit)
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/90bd801a-c75e-413f-b33a-6219898d6ddf/lock/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Release lock
DELETE {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/lock/
Authorization: {{writerToken}}


### ============================================================
### STAGE 2 — INTERNAL MEMBER APPROVES
### ============================================================

### B1. Internal member approves
###     → sets internal_approval=True
###     → automatically notifies ALL executives and ALL admins
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/
Authorization: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

###

### B2. Internal member rejects (locks content permanently)
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/
Authorization: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "reject",
  "reason": "Content does not meet our quality standards. Please rewrite the introduction."
}


### ============================================================
### STAGE 3 — EXECUTIVE (stakeholder_approval) — parallel with admin
### ============================================================

### C1. Executive approves — stakeholder sign-off
###     (only allowed after internal_approval=True)
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/
Authorization: {{executiveToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

###

### C2. Executive rejects (locks permanently)
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/
Authorization: {{executiveToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "reject",
  "reason": "The messaging does not align with our Q3 campaign strategy."
}


### ============================================================
### STAGE 3 — ADMIN (marketing_approval) — parallel with executive
### ============================================================

### D1. Admin approves — marketing sign-off
###     (only allowed after internal_approval=True)
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve"
}

###

### D2. Admin rejects (locks permanently)
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "reject",
  "reason": "SEO requirements not met. Missing primary keyword in title."
}


### ============================================================
### STAGE 4 — PUBLISH
###   Option A: Auto-publish fires 24h after all_approved_at is set (Celery)
###   Option B: Admin publishes immediately once all 3 flags are True
### ============================================================

### E1. Admin manually publishes (once all 3 approvals are done)
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "publish"
}


### ============================================================
### COMMENTS (any approver — reverts to draft while in_review)
### ============================================================

### F1. Add a comment (reverts content to draft, resets all approval flags)
POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/90bd801a-c75e-413f-b33a-6219898d6ddf/comment/
Authorization:Bearer {{reviewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment_text": "Please revise the third paragraph — the tone is too informal. @[John Writer]({{internalId}})"
}

###

### F2. Get comment history for a content piece
GET {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/comments/history/
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### F3. Resolve a comment
PATCH {{contentUrl}}/comments/resolve/{{commentId}}/
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### F4. Edit your own comment
PATCH {{contentUrl}}/comments/edit/{{commentId}}/
Authorization: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comment_text": "Revised feedback: please update the conclusion as well."
}

###

### F5. Delete your own comment
DELETE {{contentUrl}}/comments/edit/{{commentId}}/
Authorization: {{internalToken}}


