### ============================================================
### FULL HAPPY-PATH FLOW (copy & run in order)
### ============================================================

### STEP 1 — Writer creates draft
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/save/  (no content_id, submit=false)

### STEP 2 — Writer acquires lock
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/lock/

### STEP 3 — Writer submits for review (status → in_review)
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/save/  (submit=true, notify_user_ids=[internal_member_id])

### STEP 4 — Internal member approves (→ notifies all execs + admins automatically)
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/  {"action": "approve"}  (as internal)

### STEP 5a — Executive approves (parallel)
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/  {"action": "approve"}  (as executive)

### STEP 5b — Admin approves (parallel) — once both done, all_approved_at is stamped
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/  {"action": "approve"}  (as admin)

### STEP 6 — Either:
#   a) Wait 24h for auto-publish (Celery fires auto_publish_content_task)
#   b) Admin clicks publish now
#      POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/  {"action": "publish"}  (as admin)


### ============================================================
### REJECTION FLOW
### ============================================================

### STEP 1-3 same as happy path above

### STEP 4 — Anyone rejects (content locked permanently)
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/approve/
# {"action": "reject", "reason": "Does not meet brand guidelines."}

### STEP 5 — Verify content is locked
# GET {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/
# → locked_permanently: true, status: "rejected"

### STEP 6 — Attempting to lock or edit returns 423
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/lock/
# → 423 "Content is permanently locked due to rejection"


### ============================================================
### COMMENT REVERTS-TO-DRAFT FLOW
### ============================================================

### STEP 1-4 same as happy path (up to internal approval)

### STEP 5 — Admin/Executive adds comment while in_review
# POST {{contentUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}/comment/
# {"comment_text": "Please revise the title."}
# → new_status: "draft", all approval flags reset

### STEP 6 — Writer must resubmit (go back to STEP 2)
